		(property "Note" "HARNESS (stock J20 location + type, owner photos 2026-10-26): Mini-Fit Jr 2-circuit DUAL-ROW right-angle header 5569-02A2 (= 39-30-0020) with a snap-in peg, the two pins stacked perpendicular to the board, plug enters from the RIGHT edge. The owner's scan shows the stock part's single 3.3 mm peg hole on the pin axis 7.28 mm beyond the outer pin = this variant (KiCad 5569-02A2 and LCSC C240831: 7.3 mm); the flange-mount 39291028 used before has two holes 4.5 mm off-axis and is dropped. Speaker Stetron DB20-009 4 R, floating (BTL). Pins at (100.13, 48.27) / (105.67, 48.23) (scan)"
